        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "bid_pass"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid_said",
            "value": "not yet bid"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stack1_pending_reveal",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stack2_pending_reveal",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "available",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + ([you.stack1_up] if you.stack1_up not in ['', '(empty)'] else []) + ([you.stack2_up] if you.stack2_up not in ['', '(empty)'] else [])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "contract",
            "value": "not chosen yet"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "multiplier",
            "value": {
              "calc": "multiplier_no_stoss"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "declarer",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defender",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "contract_bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_card",
            "value": "none yet"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "followed_card",
            "value": "none yet"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "follow_options",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} of {hands_in_match}: seat {dealer} deals, seat {forehand} is forehand. Each player has 4 private cards and 2 stacks with one face-up card on one face-down card."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "bidding",
      "label": "your position",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Your position:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bidding",
      "label": "the sealed bids",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand == 0"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Pass",
          "53",
          "66",
          "79"
        ]
      },
      "store": "bid_said",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number}: bid in secret. Pass, 53, 66 or 79 is the number of card points you promise to take as declarer. The higher bid becomes declarer; equal bids (not Pass) make forehand (seat {forehand}) declarer at that bid; if both pass, forehand is declarer at 53."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bidding",
      "label": "the declarer",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "bid_low if you.bid_said == '53' else (bid_mid if you.bid_said == '66' else (bid_high if you.bid_said == '79' else bid_pass))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "bid_seat1",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].bid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "bid_seat2",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].bid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "declarer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].seat if players[0].bid > players[1].bid else (players[1].seat if players[1].bid > players[0].bid else forehand)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "contract_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(players[0].bid, players[1].bid) if max(players[0].bid, players[1].bid) > bid_pass else default_bid_when_both_pass"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defender",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.seat != declarer][0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Bids (0 = Pass): seat 1 bid {bid_seat1}, seat 2 bid {bid_seat2}. Seat {declarer} is declarer and must take at least {contract_bid} card points; seat {defender} defends."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bidding",
      "label": "the contract",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == declarer"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Acorns Solo",
          "Leaves Solo",
          "Hearts Solo",
          "Bells Solo",
          "Wenz"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "contract",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "trump_suit",
              "value": {
                "calc": "'Acorns' if contract == 'Acorns Solo' else ('Leaves' if contract == 'Leaves Solo' else ('Hearts' if contract == 'Hearts Solo' else ('Bells' if contract == 'Bells Solo' else 'none')))"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "strengths",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[([trump_strength_ober_acorns, trump_strength_ober_leaves, trump_strength_ober_hearts, trump_strength_ober_bells][i[5]] if (i[2] == 'Ober' and contract != 'Wenz') else ([trump_strength_unter_acorns, trump_strength_unter_leaves, trump_strength_unter_hearts, trump_strength_unter_bells][i[5]] if i[2] == 'Unter' else (trump_strength_solo_suit_ace if (i[2] == 'Ace' and i[1] == trump_suit) else (trump_strength_solo_suit_ten if (i[2] == 'Ten' and i[1] == trump_suit) else 0)))) for i in card_info]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "card_data",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[[i[0], ('Trump' if strengths[i[6]] > 0 else i[1]), strengths[i[6]], i[3], i[4]] for i in card_info]"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat}, the declarer, chooses {value} at {contract_bid}."
      },
      "text": "You are declarer at {contract_bid}. Choose the contract: Acorns Solo, Leaves Solo, Hearts Solo or Bells Solo (trumps: Obers, then Unters, then the Ace and Ten of that suit) or Wenz (trumps: the four Unters only)."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bidding",
      "label": "the Sto\u00df",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == defender"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Sto\u00df",
          "No Sto\u00df"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "multiplier",
              "value": {
                "calc": "multiplier_stoss if $answer == 'Sto\u00df' else multiplier_no_stoss"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "leader",
              "value": {
                "calc": "forehand"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "follower",
              "value": {
                "calc": "dealer"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat}, the defender, answers: {value}."
      },
      "text": "The contract is {contract} at {contract_bid}. Sto\u00df doubles the hand's value (multiplier {multiplier_stoss}) for whoever scores it; No Sto\u00df leaves it at {multiplier_no_stoss}. Either way play goes ahead."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "tricks",
      "label": "the lead",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand >= 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "available"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "led_card",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in [p.hand for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack1_pending_reveal",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack1_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack1_up",
              "value": "(empty)",
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack1_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack2_pending_reveal",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack2_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack2_up",
              "value": "(empty)",
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack2_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} leads {value}."
      },
      "text": "Trick {round_in_hand} of {tricks_per_hand}, contract {contract}. Lead one card: any card in your hand or the face-up card on top of either of your stacks."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "tricks",
      "label": "what the follower may play",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand >= 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[d[1] for d in card_data if d[0] == led_card][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "follow_options",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in [p.available for p in players if p.seat == follower][0] if [d[1] for d in card_data if d[0] == c][0] == led_suit] if len([c for c in [p.available for p in players if p.seat == follower][0] if [d[1] for d in card_data if d[0] == c][0] == led_suit]) > 0 else [p.available for p in players if p.seat == follower][0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "tricks",
      "label": "the follow",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand >= 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == follower"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "follow_options"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "followed_card",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in [p.hand for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack1_pending_reveal",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack1_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack1_up",
              "value": "(empty)",
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack1_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack2_pending_reveal",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack2_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "stack2_up",
              "value": "(empty)",
              "if": {
                "calc": "[p.stack2_up for p in players if p.seat == $seat][0] == $answer"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} follows with {value}."
      },
      "text": "Trick {round_in_hand} of {tricks_per_hand}, contract {contract}. {led_card} was led. Play one of the cards offered: if you have an available card of the led suit (all trumps are one suit) you must play one of those; otherwise any available card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "tricks",
      "label": "the trick",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand >= 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lead_str",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[d[2] for d in card_data if d[0] == led_card][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "follow_str",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[d[2] for d in card_data if d[0] == followed_card][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(leader if lead_str > follow_str else follower) if (lead_str > 0 or follow_str > 0) else ((leader if [d[4] for d in card_data if d[0] == led_card][0] > [d[4] for d in card_data if d[0] == followed_card][0] else follower) if [d[1] for d in card_data if d[0] == followed_card][0] == led_suit else leader)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[d[3] for d in card_data if d[0] == led_card][0] + [d[3] for d in card_data if d[0] == followed_card][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "hand_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "follower",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.seat != trick_winner][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "stack1_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "seat1_stack1_down"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[0].stack1_pending_reveal and seat1_stack1_down != ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat1_stack1_down",
            "value": "",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[0].stack1_pending_reveal"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "stack2_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "seat1_stack2_down"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[0].stack2_pending_reveal and seat1_stack2_down != ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat1_stack2_down",
            "value": "",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[0].stack2_pending_reveal"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "stack1_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "seat2_stack1_down"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[1].stack1_pending_reveal and seat2_stack1_down != ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat2_stack1_down",
            "value": "",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[1].stack1_pending_reveal"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "stack2_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "seat2_stack2_down"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[1].stack2_pending_reveal and seat2_stack2_down != ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "seat2_stack2_down",
            "value": "",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[1].stack2_pending_reveal"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stack1_pending_reveal",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stack2_pending_reveal",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "available",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + ([you.stack1_up] if you.stack1_up not in ['', '(empty)'] else []) + ([you.stack2_up] if you.stack2_up not in ['', '(empty)'] else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Trick {round_in_hand}: {led_card} against {followed_card}. Seat {trick_winner} wins it and takes {trick_points} card points, and leads next. Any face-down card under a played stack card is now turned face up."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "the hand is scored",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_hand == tricks_per_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "declarer_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.hand_points for p in players if p.seat == declarer][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_base",
            "value": {
              "calc": "base_for_53 if contract_bid == bid_low else (base_for_66 if contract_bid == bid_mid else base_for_79)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scorer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "declarer if declarer_points >= contract_bid else defender"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(hand_base + (all_tricks_bonus if [p.tricks_won for p in players if p.seat == scorer][0] == tricks_per_hand else 0)) * multiplier"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "scorer"
            },
            "key": "match_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "hand_score"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "card_total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand_points"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} is over. The declarer, seat {declarer}, needed {contract_bid} and took {declarer_points} card points. Seat {scorer} scores {hand_score} match points."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "advance the round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "rounds_played",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hand_number",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "round_in_hand == tricks_per_hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_in_hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "0 if round_in_hand == tricks_per_hand else round_in_hand + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "rounds_played >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "rounds_played >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.match_points * 1000 + you.card_total",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Match points: seat 1 {players[0].match_points}, seat 2 {players[1].match_points}; total card points: seat 1 {players[0].card_total}, seat 2 {players[1].card_total}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 36,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "DECK. There are {deck_size} cards: Ace, Ten, Ober and Unter in each of four suits (Acorns, Leaves, Hearts, Bells). Card points are Ace {points_ace}, Ten {points_ten}, Ober {points_ober} and Unter {points_unter}, which makes {deck_points} in the deck.\n\nMATCH. The match is {hands_in_match} hands. Each hand is one bidding round followed by {tricks_per_hand} trick rounds ({rounds_per_hand} rounds a hand), which makes {total_rounds} rounds in total. Seat 1 deals hands 1 and 3 and seat 2 deals hands 2 and 4. The non-dealer is called forehand.\n\nDEAL. At the start of each hand all 16 cards are shuffled. Each player receives {private_cards_per_player} private hand cards, seen only by their owner, and {stacks_per_player} stacks, each made of one face-down card under one face-up card. The face-up cards ({face_up_cards_on_table} in total) are visible to both players. Face-down cards are unknown to both players, including their owner.\n\nBIDDING ROUND. (1) Both players secretly and simultaneously choose a bid: Pass, {bid_low}, {bid_mid} or {bid_high}. The bid is the number of card points the player promises to take as declarer. (2) The higher bid becomes declarer at that bid. If the bids are equal and not Pass, forehand is declarer at that bid. If both pass, forehand is declarer at {default_bid_when_both_pass}. Both bids are then announced. (3) The declarer chooses a contract and it is announced. Acorns Solo, Leaves Solo, Hearts Solo or Bells Solo: trumps are, from highest to lowest, Ober of Acorns, Ober of Leaves, Ober of Hearts, Ober of Bells, Unter of Acorns, Unter of Leaves, Unter of Hearts, Unter of Bells, then the Ace and the Ten of the chosen suit; the three other suits each hold only Ace above Ten. Wenz: trumps are, from highest to lowest, Unter of Acorns, Unter of Leaves, Unter of Hearts, Unter of Bells; each suit holds Ace above Ten above Ober. (4) The defender chooses Sto\u00df (double) or No Sto\u00df, and the choice is announced. The multiplier is {multiplier_stoss} with Sto\u00df and {multiplier_no_stoss} without; either way the hand is played.\n\nTRICK ROUNDS. Available cards: a player may play any of their private hand cards or any face-up card on top of one of their stacks. Lead: in the first trick forehand leads; afterwards the winner of the previous trick leads. The leader plays one available card. Follow: the other player then plays one available card. All trumps count as one suit, the trump suit, so in a Solo an Ober or Unter is never a card of its printed suit (and in Wenz an Unter never is). If the follower has an available card of the led suit, they must play one; otherwise they may play any available card. You are only offered cards you may legally play. Trick winner: if any trump was played, the higher trump wins (a lone trump always wins). Otherwise the higher card of the led suit wins, and a card of another suit loses. The winner adds the card points of both cards to their card-point total for this hand (hand_points) and wins 1 trick. Reveal: after the trick, any face-down card whose face-up card was played this trick is turned face up. It is available from the next trick on; a stack with no cards left is shown as (empty).\n\nHAND SCORING (after trick {tricks_per_hand}). If the declarer's card points are at least their bid, the declarer scores the contract value in match points; otherwise the defender scores it. Contract value = base, plus {all_tricks_bonus} if the player who scores took all {tricks_per_hand} tricks, multiplied by the Sto\u00df multiplier. The base is {base_for_53} for a bid of {bid_low}, {base_for_66} for a bid of {bid_mid} and {base_for_79} for a bid of {bid_high}. For example, a 66 bid made with Sto\u00df and not every trick scores 6. Each player's card points for the hand are also added to their running card-point total for the match (card_total). Then all cards are collected for the next deal.\n\nWINNER. After {hands_in_match} hands, the player with more match points wins. If match points are equal, the player with the higher total card points over all hands wins. If both are equal, the match is a draw and the players share the result."
}
